content.text:
The root cause is a slow database path inside ts-consign-service, and it reaches users through ts-ui-dashboard.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-consign-service",
      "fault_kind": "database_call_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6,2) p95_ms, round(avg(duration)/1e6,2) avg_ms FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND span_name='SELECT ts.consign_record' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Normal period: consign_record SELECT client span p95 about 1.2 ms, avg 0.76 ms."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95_ms, round(avg(duration)/1e6,1) avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND span_name IN ('SELECT ts.consign_record','INSERT ts.consign_record') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Abnormal period: consign_record DB client spans p95 about 3,147 ms (SELECT) and 1,533 ms (INSERT)."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND attr_span_kind='Client' AND span_name LIKE 'GET%' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Consign's outgoing HTTP call to consign-price-service stays about 10-20 ms, so the slowdown is inside consign's own DB work."},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT metric, round(avg(value),3) v FROM normal_metrics_sum WHERE service_name='mysql' AND metric='k8s.pod.cpu.usage' GROUP BY ALL UNION ALL SELECT metric, round(avg(value),3) FROM abnormal_metrics_sum WHERE service_name='mysql' AND metric='k8s.pod.cpu.usage' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "mysql pod CPU usage did not rise in the abnormal period, so the database server is not saturated."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-consign-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_http_response_status_code code, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE (service_name='ts-consign-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server') OR (service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND span_name LIKE '%consign%') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Consign server GET/PUT spans reach 4-16 s p95, and ui-dashboard's consign calls show the same latency, with 500 errors on order lookups."}]}
  ]
}
```

I found no evidence of a network fault. The consign connections show no drops and roughly unchanged flow counts, and mysql's pod CPU fell. The broader slowdowns in basic, seat, travel2 and food are real but modest. Their own DB spans are unchanged and I could not tie them to a fault, so I did not name them.

